  <p id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:opening" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:opening:m0000" ref="468_0bf_170">王凌</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:opening:m0003" ref="468_0bf_170">彥雲</persName>，太原祁人也。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:later" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">乃發<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:later:m0002" ref="468_0bf_170">凌</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-jin098-dun:later:m0004" ref="43d_e5c_69f">愚</persName>塚，剖棺，暴屍於所近市三日，燒其印綬、朝服，親土埋之。</p>
</text>
